@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam titleFontColor black
skinparam footerFontColor black
skinparam ArrowFontColor black
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam LineColor black
skinparam classBackgroundColor white
skinparam classBorderColor black
skinparam classHeaderBackgroundColor white
skinparam componentBackgroundColor white
skinparam componentBorderColor black
skinparam stateBackgroundColor white
skinparam stateBorderColor black
skinparam noteBackgroundColor white
skinparam noteBorderColor black
title 03 订单状态图 - 行为性图
footer 复核后设计 | 酒店REQ-001至REQ-032
state "待确认" as Pending
state "已确认" as Confirmed
state "已入住" as CheckedIn
state "已完成" as Completed
state "已取消" as Cancelled
[*] --> Pending : 创建成功/占全部晚, v=1
Pending --> Confirmed : 酒店确认\n[t <= waitingSince+30分钟]
Pending --> Pending : 修改成功且本轮未过期\nv+1, 重计时
Confirmed --> Pending : 修改成功\nv+1, 重计时
Pending --> Cancelled : 普通取消/释放全部占用, 费用0
Confirmed --> Cancelled : 普通取消且实际未入住\n释放全部占用, 费用0
Pending --> Cancelled : 超时\n[t > waitingSince+30分钟]
Confirmed --> CheckedIn : 入住成功/分配空闲实体房
CheckedIn --> Completed : 退房成功/房间待清洁
Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
note right of Pending
旧版本任务跳过.
修改失败不改周期或版本.
已过期的确认/修改先执行超时取消.
修改以全部必要锁取得后的最终t判定.
end note
note bottom of CheckedIn
已入住/已完成不能普通修改或取消.
待协调为独立标记, 不增加第六态.
end note
@enduml
